      "subject": "fix(builder): runtime boot, manual stop, file writes and health badge bugs, and runtime workspace types (MS-2026-0006)",
      "body": "With React's types installed the Builder reports 231 type errors; this fixes 53. Real bugs: three useRuntimeBoot branches for a stopped runtime referenced an undefined projectId and threw instead of showing the stopped message; manualStop.ts imported its own exports, colliding with its declarations; api.writeFile passed positional arguments to writeRuntimeFile, which takes one object, so the request body was only the project id (no caller yet); and the runtime health badge used variants LuminaBadge does not have, so it showed no status colour (now complete, partial, blocked and muted). Type-only fixes: Lucide icon prop types accept strokeWidth as string or number as Lucide declares, RuntimeOverview renamed to RuntimeOverall, a checked log level setter, AUTH_ERROR as an error code, Project imported from its declaration, jsPDF as a type-only import, a typed __PROVIDERS__ window global, and an ignored setView prop removed. 178 remain; both UI contracts unchanged.\n\nMission: MS-2026-0006\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AHtXdN7VRusNxTFHzk5uFe",
